      "title": "iSCSI Fix LBAs and display Binary Prefix sizes",
      "message": "iSCSI Fix LBAs and display Binary Prefix sizes\n\nLBAs are zero-based thus one(1) must be added to them.\n\nThe existing Read Capicty sizes in dissect_sbc_readcapacity10()\nare displayed in SI rather than Binary Prefixe format. Since the\nbyte capacity sizes are calculated in 1024-byte chunks, they must\nbe displayed as Binary Prefixes. These abbreviations are now\ndisplayed in the Packet Detail and List panes.\n",
      "author_name": "Cal Turney",
      "author_email": "cturney111@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2023-11-07T16:44:04.000-05:00",
      "committer_name": "Cal Turney",
      "committer_email": "cturney111@gmail.com",
      "committed_date": "2023-11-07T23:00:10.000+00:00",
      "trailers": {},
      "extended_trailers": {},
      "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/b4353492712c98f696d82e938db15ee454085173"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a404a610d15bd5f94f3e2adc84539121aa42ff5",
      "short_id": "3a404a61",
      "created_at": "2023-11-07T23:00:10.000+00:00",
      "parent_ids": [
        "99a7079bc0ea8a377968f3dc893e8060ff520128"
      ],
      "title": "TCP: changed \"[TCP segment of a reassembled PDU]\"",
      "message": "TCP: changed \"[TCP segment of a reassembled PDU]\"\n\nChanged \"[TCP segment of a reassembled PDU]\"\n     to \"[TCP PDU reassembled in <frame>]\" in the Packet List\nThis also fixes a bug where \"[TCP segment of a reassembled PDU]\" was\nbeing displayed in segments that were not reassembled such as in\nthe case at the end of a capture where all of the segments of a PDU\nare not present.\n",
      "author_name": "Cal Turney",
      "author_email": "cturney111@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2023-10-28T15:46:33.000-04:00",
      "committer_name": "Cal Turney",
